## Plain-language summary (not part of the licence)

This section is a plain-English summary. It is not part of the licence and
carries no legal weight. Where the two disagree, the text above is what counts,
and if the difference matters to you, ask a lawyer rather than us.

**You can**: use it, read it, change it, build products on it, run it inside
your company, ship it inside something you sell, and fork it. Commercially,
without asking and without paying.

**You cannot**: take weft and offer it back to other people as a hosted service
whose main value is weft itself. Running weft to power your own product is
fine. Running weft *as* the product, for third parties, is the one thing
clause 2 is about.

**You must**: keep the copyright notice and the licence text with any copy or
substantial portion you distribute.

Unsure which side of the line you are on? Email contact@weavemind.ai and ask.

If you want to offer weft as a hosted service anyway, for example as part of a cloud
platform, we are open to collaboration: email contact@weavemind.ai. Hosted-use licensing and partnerships are available by separate agreement.
